### REGISTER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "joaquin",
    "password": "Abcd1234",
    "email": "joaquin@localhost.com"
}

### LOGIN USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "joaquin",
    "password": "Abcd1234"
}

### LOGIN ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "Abcd1234"
}

